\ An off-path attacker against a line echo server (tools/netpeer.py tcp-attack)
variable served
: (serve) ( conn -- ) begin pad 256 2 pick get-line dup 0< 0= while pad swap 2 pick send-line repeat 2drop ;
: serve ( conn -- ) 10000 io-timeout !  dup ['] (serve) catch if drop then  close-connection  1 served +! ;
: line-server ( -- ) 5000 listen begin 5000 accept-connection ['] serve spawn drop again ;
1 max-syn-retries !  16 max-half-open !
task server  ' line-server server start
: late ( conn -- ) 2000 ms  dup >r s" a line, late" r> ['] send-line catch if 2drop drop then  close-connection  1 served +! ;
: late-server ( -- ) 5001 listen begin 5001 accept-connection ['] late spawn drop again ;
task lates  ' late-server lates start
: settled? ( -- flag ) served @ 9 = conns @ 0= and ;
: settle ( -- ) 80000 deadline begin 200 ms settled? over expired? or until drop ;
settle .tcp ." , half-open " half-open .
1000 ms
